1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,606
Open any Markdown file, press Open Preview.
You get a styled page, not raw text.

2
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:07,326
Front matter becomes a clean properties table.

3
00:00:07,692 --> 00:00:11,292
Edit where you read.
Switch on edit mode, click a paragraph, type.

4
00:00:12,052 --> 00:00:14,291
Select, press Cmd+B: bold, right in the page.

5
00:00:14,411 --> 00:00:15,976
Save, and the page updates in place.

6
00:00:16,096 --> 00:00:19,896
Type / for the slash menu:
tables, admonitions, diagrams and more.

7
00:00:23,139 --> 00:00:25,939
Save: a styled Tip admonition lands in the document.

8
00:00:26,451 --> 00:00:29,851
MyST cards and tabs render natively.
Click a tab to switch.

9
00:00:33,655 --> 00:00:37,055
Vega-Lite charts and Mermaid diagrams, drawn in the page.

10
00:00:42,458 --> 00:00:45,658
Review in context: comment on any sentence.

11
00:00:50,783 --> 00:00:54,183
The change bar marks what you edited since the last commit.

12
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:59,346
A table of contents, a toolbar that rolls up,
and a theme for every taste.

13
00:01:02,519 --> 00:01:05,719
Cream by default. Dark when you want it.

